{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260506175644aca3fb84c52d4dc1","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a clear picture of all the existing services. Let me create the ContextEngine that:\n\n1. Defines FusedReminder struct\n2. Defines DisplayPriority enum\n3. Implements generate() with fusion algorithm\n4. Calls CalendarService + WeatherService + PreferenceLearner\n5. Time-based branching (morning→calendar+weather, noon→density+weather, evening→tomorrow+temp drop)\n6. Preference filtering via getDislikedCategories()\n7. Dedup via UserDefaults hash, max 100 entries\n8. Graceful degradation\n\nLet me create it now.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"33d24eb8-fca9-4f18-9721-28897c4bbc1b","uuid":"de0bd562-3e0a-435d-8f7d-2b3ebc5e9360"}
